<title>USA: Raymond James Financial sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>Raymond James Financial sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James Financial Inc said on Friday it set a three-for-two stock split of its common shares.</p>
<p>The split will bring the company's total shares outstanding to 31.5 million.</p>
<p>The company also increased its share-repurchase authorization to 1.5 million shares, from 1 million.</p>
<p>Pay date for the split is April 3 for shareholders of record on March 7.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
